Sval: the HTTPS-Only Mode warning page says what is at risk in plain words

The page named the mode, "HTTPS", and "mixed content blocking", and
never said what an unsecured site exposes or when to stay away. It says
who could read what you send, when opening the site is fine, when it is
not, and how long the choice to open it lasts.

